    "detailed_description": "<strong>Glow Hockey</strong> delivers a new style of hockey game. Easy to play, hard to master. Challenge yourself with your friend and the computer opponents!<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br>+ Local Wifi multiplayer<br>+ 2-player mode (on the same device).<br>+ 3 game slots in Championship mode.<br>+ 11 table themes.<br>+ 4 selectable paddles and pucks.<br>+ Landscape &amp; Portrait view.<br>+ Multiple puck sizes (S, M, L).<br>+ Multi-puck (up to 10 pucks at the same time).<br>+ Rule settings for score and optionally with timeout.<br>+ Colorful glow graphics.<br>+ Smooth and responsive game play.<br>+ Realistic physics.<br>+ Quick play mode (single player), challenge yourself with 4 difficulty levels (Easy to Insane).",
